anguage and International Studies\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and  \nstatutes of the United States of America, in order to extend for five months  \nthe life of the President’s Commission on Foreign Language and Intemationai  \nStudies, Section 4 of Executive Order No. 12054 of April 21, 1978, is amend­\ned to read as follows:\n“Sec. 4. Termination and Final Report. The Commission shall submit its final  \nreport to the President not later than eleven months after its first meeting and  \nshall terminate thirty days thereafter.’’.\nT he  W h it e H o u s e,\nOctober 31, 1978.\n[FR Doc. 78-31166 Filed 10-31-78; 4:12 pm]\nFEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 43, NO. 213— THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 2, 1978\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12090.txt","sha256":"c6f53815aa85decf8da408d7b6244ed397b21a29972da81225529106df6aa4ca","source":{"line":1605,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"ad7a0f378c1329f33a8adcd3e9be135c0d863935d21e9b8d2fbc51fcbaf33566"}}]}
